  Gia tri trong Ellipsis duoc gem5tomcpat.py tinh tu gem5:
    S('ten')      tong cac stat khop ten; '*' = so thu tu core (cpu, cpu0, cpu1...). Thieu stat -> bao loi
    S('ten', 0)   nhu tren, nhung thieu thi lay 0 (stat gem5 khong in khi bang 0)
    C('duong.dan') gia tri trong config.json (danh sach thi lay phan tu dau)
    N   so core      MHZ  xung (MHz)      CYC  so chu ky cua khoang do = simTicks / chu ky xung
  Gia tri khong co Ellipsis la gia dinh co dinh, lay tu file mau ARM_A9_2GHz.xml cua McPAT
  hoac theo CVA6 (ghi chu ben canh).
-->
